## Must know

### Primary Key

Uniquely identifies a row.

### Foreign Key

Creates a relationship between tables.

### Normalization

Reduces redundancy and undesirable dependencies.

### ACID

```text
A → Atomicity
C → Consistency
I → Isolation
D → Durability
```

### Index

Makes certain queries faster by maintaining an additional access structure, but consumes storage and can increase write/update cost.

