# TCP vs UDP

| TCP                 | UDP                        |
| ------------------- | -------------------------- |
| Connection-oriented | Connectionless             |
| Reliable delivery   | No delivery guarantee      |
| Ordered             | No ordering guarantee      |
| Retransmission      | No built-in retransmission |
| More overhead       | Lower overhead             |

---

# 🔥 TCP 3-WAY HANDSHAKE

```text
Client                 Server

  SYN  ───────────────→

       ←──────── SYN + ACK

  ACK  ───────────────→
```

Then data transfer can begin.

